WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:07.900
Yo yo yo, what's good? this week we fiendin for meaning

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.440
with Grendel by John Gardner.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:17.289
It’s been nearly 12 years since a
nappy-lookin beast named Grendel first started

00:00:17.289 --> 00:00:22.140
beefin with King Hrothgar and his peeps. After
wreckin their meadhall like he always do-

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:25.470
he starts thinkin back bout when he was a
lil’ rug-rat.

00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:29.929
Tired of hearing his mama say “dool-
dool” all the time, this lonely-ass thug

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:34.360
decide to see what’s good in the upperworld.
After gettin stuck in a tree, Grendel try

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:38.860
to conversate with some humans rollin by,
but they don’t understand a damn word he

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:44.020
say. So Grendel’s mama gotta step up, get
CRUNK on dem humans, and save his ass.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.800
Later, G-diddy watch some blind
fool called “The Shaper” lay down some

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.950
next level rhymes talkin up the Danes of old
like they all righteous. Even though he know

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:56.510
The Shaper spittin lies, he wanna believe
it’s the truth.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:01:00.510
Grendel runs up on dat meadhall
beggin for peace and hugz. But all them Danes

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:06.360
see is a big fugly monster screamin nonsense,
so they whip out their chrome and chase him

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:06.720
away.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:11.100
One day, Grendel finds himself
chillin with a dragon sittin on a PHAT stack

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:16.300
o’ bling. The dragon say the world’s a
meaningless, mechanical void, and human beings-

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:21.500
specially The Shaper- just tryin to fill dat
void with pretty bullsh**. Since we all gonna

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.590
die, the only thing worth doin is stackin
change like old folks, and plantin our fat

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:28.000
asses on it.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.850
Later 14 Geats led by Beowulf drop
in on the land of the Danes. When Grendel

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:38.780
peeps game Wulfy, it seems like his words
don’t fit his mouth. Dafuq?? There’s somethin

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.120
shady bout this thug.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:44.670
That night, Grendel decide: it’s
time to wreck shop. So he busts in to dat

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.330
meadhall and starts bangin with Beowulf.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:52.799
Wulfy smacks his up, throw him dome
against the wall and say:” You my bitch

00:01:52.799 --> 00:01:57.360
now. Sing walls sucka!” Then straight RIPS
his arm off.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:01.670
Grendel stumbles outside and right
before he dies, he say “Poor Grendel had

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:04.570
an accident... so may you all.”

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:11.570
Now if you ain’t already in the
know, Grendel the same gnarly beastie from

00:02:11.780 --> 00:02:16.799
the epic poem Beowulf. Cept in Gardner’s
work, we hearin the story from Grendel’s

00:02:16.799 --> 00:02:20.189
perspective. And he one wicked smart G.

00:02:20.189 --> 00:02:23.279
Gren-deezy so slick that none of the animals
in his hood can keep

00:02:23.279 --> 00:02:23.730
up.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:27.680
Even his own mama don’ understand
him. And since them punk-ass humans ain’t

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.549
nothin but a bunch of violent haters, Grendel
feel like he all alone.

00:02:31.549 --> 00:02:38.549
Matter of fact, when Grendel gets
stuck in that tree, he decide there ain’t

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:46.510
nothin 
in this world cept him.

00:02:53.790 --> 00:02:57.870
As lil’ Grendel gets older, he
meets some G-ed up hustlas who make him marinate

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.419
on all kinds of philosphies.

00:02:59.419 --> 00:03:04.290
The shaper always bustin sick flows
bout Danish myths that give them dopey-ass

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:09.139
Danes a sense of meaning to their lives. He
gives em hope by telling them that life is

00:03:09.139 --> 00:03:10.480
straight up righteous.

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:15.010
Whereas dat hood-rich dragon don’t
play dat game. He say all those values ain’t

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:20.069
nothin but lies told to keep stupid fools
happy.

00:03:20.069 --> 00:03:27.069
How’s a brotha gonna argue with a
dragon? After talkin wit dat scaley scrub,

00:03:29.559 --> 00:03:34.409
Grendel takes a big ol hit o dat nihilistic
blunt and finally has a mission in life- if

00:03:34.409 --> 00:03:38.790
he can’t be accepted as man’s homie, then
might as well be the mindless thug they see

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:39.799
him as.

00:03:39.799 --> 00:03:43.989
Not only did Grendel’s mind get
fu**ed by a literal dragon, but a symbolic

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:48.620
one too. When Grendel first peeps game at
Beowulf, he knows SOMETHING’S UP. Later,

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:54.159
he thinks he sees fire in his eyes and wings
poppin out of his shoulders. And like any

00:03:54.159 --> 00:04:01.159
good dragon, Beowulf don’t just wreck Grendel’s
arm, he also wrecks 
his philosophy.

00:04:27.009 --> 00:04:31.710
Beowulf basically sayin: “Look,
son. Whether you sneer at life like dat dragon

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:36.750
or try to dream up a better world and hustle
to make it a reality all Shaper-style, it

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:41.520
don’t mean a damn thing. There’s a hell
of a lot more going on here than just you.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:45.650
So spit whatever verses you want. Life goes
on playboy.

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:50.740
And nothing goes on as fine as Thug
Notes gear. Sing Swag, B! See you next week.

